  "repo_truth": "Review 1 independently admitted the exact 21-path atomic-stage subject and returned two Required findings plus one Nit. The parent accepted all without waiver. This exact 22-path remediated subject removes the stale promotion-only pending intent.tmp protocol in favor of already-selected whole-file .intent-staging publication and empty-only pre-intent recovery; adds explicit S0 crash outcomes and an exact 36-pair purpose-by-boundary fault product; and corrects two research filenames. Intent 1.2 remains byte-for-byte unchanged, the original dirty implementation remains externally snapshotted and untouched, and no Rust, immutable prior evidence, or HCM-2.3 surface changed.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Remain read-only and replay all 22 manifest hashes, lexical order, and aggregate before review.",
    "Independently re-review the entire complete identity/currentness/persistence/recovery subject, not only Review 1 findings or their remediation account.",
    "Adversarially verify promotion intent whole-file publication and empty-only pre-intent recovery; the exact unique 36-pair S0-S11 fault product; absent-or-exact output stages; scratch non-authority; W0-W15/R0-R9 closure; collision, mismatch-preservation, marker, canonical.old, and terminal fsync rules.",
    "Return findings first with exact file/line evidence, failure mode, smallest bounded repair, and missing validation."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No edits, staging, commits, handoff/ledger writes, snapshot mutation, or user task hops.",
    "No Rust/test work, implementation resumption, intent-schema widening, legacy fallback, dual read, relaxed validation, prior-evidence rewrite, HCM-2.3 work, or adjacent cleanup.",
    "Do not inherit Review 1 or parent conclusions; derive the whole verdict independently."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Invoke the ordered required skills and return BLOCKED on any subject-manifest mismatch.",
    "Verify the complete identity graph, schemas/vectors, persistence, migration, currentness, writer/recovery, collision, mismatch, and fault-test grammar is exact, total, and mutually consistent.",
    "Prove promotion pending intent exposes only empty or complete intent.json, the exact 36 fault pairs are complete and unique, all three pending output stages are writer absent-or-exact, and scratch never selects or changes recovery.",
    "Return CLEAN only when no Critical, Required, Optional, or Nit finding remains; otherwise return CHANGES_REQUIRED or BLOCKED without repair."
  ],
